OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry overnight with clear spells for
OL,7,Fmany, variable amounts of cloud will
OL,8,Fcontinue to feed in across Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall. Light winds allowing for a
OL,10,Ffew mist and fog patches to develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start, particularly
OL,13,Fin the east, with a cloudier start in
OL,14,Fthe west. However, this cloud will
OL,15,Flift and break, allowing sunny spells
OL,16,Fto develop here too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
